{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmgPbLQAJgbgiAFThNXk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll call you about it before I do anything. I didn't find anything at Harel I could say is as safe as my deposits. The fee looks like about half a percent a year, and for the safe-sounding tracks there was no result to see. I'm not very sure of any of this.\n\n**What decided it**\n- The page opens with funds and English letters like \"S&P 500\". There's nothing about deposits or interest.\n- The one thing I know is safe, \"אג\"ח סחיר\" (traded bonds), had no result. It just said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", which I think means it's less than three years old.\n- The big result that stayed with me, \"24.04%\" over 3 years, is the \"מניות\" track (shares). Shares are exactly where I lost money before.\n- The fee is the same everywhere, \"0.54%\" to \"0.61%\" \"מהחיסכון\" (of the savings) each year. In small grey writing it says there are more costs on top of that, \"הוצאות ישירות\" (direct expenses), and that they don't appear here.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **The top.** \"הראל\" and that the numbers run to September 2026. The product buttons, with \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" picked. Then a row of buttons, one with English letters, S-and-P 500. That's where I almost left.\n2. **The big table.** Lots of rows, little rings in two colours and percentages. I looked at \"מניות\", \"אג\"ח סחיר\" and \"כספי (שקלי)\". The last one showed \"4.25%\" for 3 years and \"3.08%\" for 5, but I don't know what \"כספי\" is.\n3. **Under the table, small grey lines.** \"התקרה בחוק: 1.05%...\" (the legal maximum). Then that the result is before fees and before tax, and \"לא אומרת מה יקרה בהמשך\" (it doesn't say what will happen next).\n4. **The bottom.** A long list of closed sections: \"קרנות מחקות\", \"קרנות סל\", \"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\". I didn't open them.\n\n**Words I didn't understand:** קופה with numbers like 15283, \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"גמיש\", \"קיימות\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"קרנות מחקות\", \"קרנות סל\", \"PF-10\". Also the two colours in the rings: green and yellow look almost the same to me. I don't know if \"12.4%\" for 3 years means each year or all together.\n\n**Where I got tired:** By the second screen, with all those numbers on black, I was anxious. I was tired at the bottom and wouldn't have opened anything else. The grey lines under the table were hard to read even enlarged. A site I've never heard of, \"מקור\", I wouldn't give money to."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1965,"cache_read_input_tokens":9834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1965},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"709f8901-770c-401f-87e1-bc0203134134","uuid":"69e1f9ea-c86e-40be-97b8-76fa56e7bded","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:32:45.951Z","request_id":"req_011CgmgPazKaKE2Yywu12iwh"}
